From bb4f75b44098b47eebfe4ea9e3f0aa338b0a9c50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Release Tool <build@givelotus.org>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Prepare Lotus 11.6.1 release metadata

Keep daemon version, Arch recipes and container inputs consistent.
Preserve historical patches and chain data; record explicit network
inputs and verification evidence separately when selected.

Generated reproducibly by daemon/scripts/prepare-release.py; the
fixed author date is an artifact epoch, not a historical attribution.

